     ],
     "text": "Assuming **one adult, one-way**, Alaska Airlines currently advertises **Saver fares from $391 USD** for **Seattle (SEA) → Anchorage (ANC) on November 14, 2026**. This is the no-frills fare option listed on its route page. ([alaskaair.com](https://www.alaskaair.com/en/flights-from-seattle-to-anchorage))\n\n**Where to book:** [Alaska Airlines’ Seattle–Anchorage booking page](https://www.alaskaair.com/en/flights-from-seattle-to-anchorage). Select **one-way**, **November 14, 2026**, and **Saver**, and decline optional extras.\n\n**Important:** This is an advertised starting fare, not a verified checkout total. Alaska notes that displayed fares may no longer be available when booking and optional baggage or services can cost extra. I couldn’t confirm a final purchasable total. ([alaskaair.com](https://www.alaskaair.com/en/flights-from-seattle-to-anchorage))\n\nSOURCES: Alaska Airlines (alaskaair.com).",
